From cfa54eceefa5716c0f5dd7456722e1614b8c6c56 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 14:15:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] HTDESIGNER-68: Name / Alias typed in, event names typed, web
 JS events generated; JS -> C++ wiring seen (0.68.0)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

EastSun 20260930: "你這邊名稱都要讓我改 alias / 網路js監聽器也要讓我填function / 然後我改了
之後系統都要自動幫我生成更改後的程式碼", then on BtnPanelLane3's empty 事件表: "應該有click吧? 他是
連到C++的", and IO_Table.csv still as text: "開CSV 怎還是一樣的畫面?".
- Name (the id) and Alias rows at the top of the editable section. Name = the
  rename (title, <label for>, and now the htdEvents bindings follow). Alias =
  the "｜Alias=..." part of the title the IO page's JS reads
  (title.match(/Alias=([^｜|\s]+)/)), with the IO table's names
  (W906_IOTABLE_PATH / IO_Table.csv, read only) to pick from and a warning for
  one not in it (lib/aliasedit.js).
- 事件表: a handler name can be typed -- an empty event gets a C++ handler of
  that name; one the designer added is renamed in the class (.h) and every
  TfXxx::name of the .cpp (cppstub.renameEdits); the .dfm's are not renamed.
- 網頁事件 (the page's own JS): one field per DOM event; a name writes the
  function and addEventListener into ONE designer-kept block at the end of the
  page (<script id="htdEvents">, lib/jsevents.js), a new name renames it (its
  code kept), clearing takes the binding out (an empty function too); the
  function opens.
- 事件表 sees events wired through the page's JS: its listener sends a WS
  command the server dispatches to C++ (BtnPanelLane3, not in the .dfm:
  OnClick = ht9045_io_do.js -> io.btnPanelClick -> wb_serve.cpp:671 ->
  W906_DispatchIoClick); the operator-token commands (control.*) are skipped.
  The command trace (websearch.calledNames) now follows a bare call of a page
  function named like a DOM method -- the IO page's own send(el, a, down) was
  skipped as if it were WebSocket.send.
- a .csv shown in a text tab (one open since before the update comes back as
  text, a click in the explorer only brings it forward) is switched to the
  table by itself -- not a diff, not one opened as text on purpose; setting
  ht9045Designer.csvAutoTable.

Tests (all 4 layers pass): lib (jsevents add / rename keeping code / clear /
follow a renamed id; aliasedit incl. the real IO table, read only; cppstub
rename; the trace through send()), smoke (typed names, rename, Alias into the
title, web event generated and renamed, the csv auto switch), real VS Code
(a web event written, the redrawn page binds it, reverted; BtnPanelLane3
OnClick -> W906_DispatchIoClick; a text tab of a csv copy switches by itself).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
